964
representation and (b) specifically the single transferable vote electoral system, in connection with his proposals to reorganise local government in Scotland;

Dr. Godman: To ask the Secretary of State for Scotland (1) what recent discussions he has held with the chairman of the Scottish Arts Council concerning the role of the
988
council in relation to the determination of such moneys which may come its way from the national lottery; and if he will make a statement;
